{"unit_id":"rentaoyan0628-collab__dsh-bili-danmaku-lite#feature-1","repo":"rentaoyan0628-collab/dsh-bili-danmaku-lite","commit":"69bde824264d916d889dbab60af51a333915db32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bili-danmaku-lite 的功能「房间信息与弹幕查询」：读取已放行直播间的信息和最近弹幕历史。通过查询工具触发，输入房间号、主播名或 UID，返回房间状态及弹幕内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["python/live_mcp.py:306-332"]}
{"unit_id":"rentaoyan0628-collab__dsh-bili-danmaku-lite#feature-2","repo":"rentaoyan0628-collab/dsh-bili-danmaku-lite","commit":"69bde824264d916d889dbab60af51a333915db32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bili-danmaku-lite 的功能「授权发送弹幕」：向已放行房间发送一条文字弹幕。由工具调用触发，需提供房间、内容及确认参数；发送默认关闭，并有每房间发送间隔限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:699-715","python/live_mcp.py:493-523"]}
{"unit_id":"rentaoyan0628-collab__dsh-bili-danmaku-lite#feature-3","repo":"rentaoyan0628-collab/dsh-bili-danmaku-lite","commit":"69bde824264d916d889dbab60af51a333915db32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bili-danmaku-lite 的功能「后台监听与提醒」：后台 worker 收取已放行房间的弹幕并记录提示，也可向配置的 webhook 发提醒。通过挂机工具或设置页启动，状态工具查看运行情况。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:739-757","python/live_mcp.py:999-1025"]}
{"unit_id":"rentaoyan0628-collab__dsh-bili-danmaku-lite#feature-4","repo":"rentaoyan0628-collab/dsh-bili-danmaku-lite","commit":"69bde824264d916d889dbab60af51a333915db32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bili-danmaku-lite 的功能「直播声音转录」：把已放行直播间的声音转成带时间戳的文字，并保留配置的最近片段。通过转录启动工具或设置页触发，可选择识别模型、设备和音频窗口；转录本身不会发送弹幕。","source":"generated","evidence":["python/live_mcp.py:1262-1285"]}
{"unit_id":"rentaoyan0628-collab__dsh-bili-danmaku-lite#feature-5","repo":"rentaoyan0628-collab/dsh-bili-danmaku-lite","commit":"69bde824264d916d889dbab60af51a333915db32","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bili-danmaku-lite 的功能「离线直播高光查询」：按日期、编号或关键词检索预先生成的候选时间点、判定理由和对应弹幕。通过高光查询工具触发，结果基于弹幕文本并非画面确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["python/live_mcp.py:1452-1481"]}
